{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/directions-issued-to-slough-borough-council-february-2026","content_id":"83908483-e1e2-4aaf-8926-75bbc5749f96","description":"Statutory directions issued to Slough Borough Council relating to its special educational needs and disability provision and children’s social care provision.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69a5743346e50eda5c46b56a","filename":"SEND_statutory_direction_Slough_Feb_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":151423,"filename":"SEND_statutory_direction_Slough_Feb_2026.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280870","isbn":"","number_of_pages":6,"title":"Revised direction issued to Slough Borough Council relating to SEND provision (February 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a5743346e50eda5c46b56a/SEND_statutory_direction_Slough_Feb_2026.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"699da82b3e672177d0bc7598","filename":"Slough_Borough_Council_Eighth_Statutory_Direction_CSC_Feb_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":272954,"filename":"Slough_Borough_Council_Eighth_Statutory_Direction_CSC_Feb_2026.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280871","isbn":"","number_of_pages":19,"title":"Revised direction issued to Slough Borough Council relating to children’s social care provision (February 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/699da82b3e672177d0bc7598/Slough_Borough_Council_Eighth_Statutory_Direction_CSC_Feb_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The revised direction for special educational needs (<abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr>) recognises the decision of the Secretary of State to appoint Deborah Glassbrook as <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> Commissioner for Slough Borough Council. This follows the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-borough-council--4\">revoked first <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> direction issued to Slough Borough Council</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The revised direction for children’s social care recognises the decision of the Secretary of State to appoint Jacqueline Wilson as Children’s Services Improvement Adviser for Slough Borough Council, and incorporates the area for priority action from <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://files.ofsted.gov.uk/v1/file/50293403\">Ofsted’s focused visit (published January 2026)</a>. This direction follows the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-borough-council--4\">revoked seventh direction issued to Slough Borough Council</a>.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-11T12:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9280870","9280871"],"first_public_at":"2026-02-11T12:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-02-11T12:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/directions-issued-to-sloug